@title Ctrl+K: the PLC input card macro entry says it is symbols and where the card comes from
@area Command field
# Critical audit C-59 (S4): the entry read "24 V PLC card" and gave no hint it is symbols only.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text plc input card
wait 10
expect "add the card via Add PLC card"
shot search-results
check_layout
